Sandseal is an independent implementation, written from scratch in Rust, that
builds on concepts from Hole:

    Hole — https://github.com/lukashornych/hole
    Copyright Lukas Hornych
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

No source code from Hole is distributed as part of this product. The
attribution above is given because Sandseal's sandbox model — running an AI
coding agent inside a disposable Docker container with host networking, a
persistent agent home volume and secrets hidden behind /dev/null bind mounts —
originates in that project.
